# 15. Performance Requirements

Performance requirements must contain measurable targets.

Bad:

> The application should be scalable.

Good:

```text
PERF-001

The system shall support at least 10 concurrent file-processing
jobs without exceeding the defined CPU, memory, database connection,
and messaging limits.

PERF-002

Transaction processing shall use bounded concurrency.

PERF-003

The application shall not load an entire input file into memory
when streaming processing is possible.
```

