# 16. Multi-Data-Center Requirements

For your platform, make these explicit.

Example:

```text
DC-001 — Multi-DC Processing

The application shall support active processing from both DC1 and DC2.

Requirements:

1. Multiple pods may process concurrently.
2. The same business transaction shall not produce duplicate
   business effects.
3. Work ownership shall be durable.
4. DC failure shall allow recoverable work to be processed by
   the surviving DC.
5. Storage failure shall not cause uncontrolled retry loops.
6. Processing state shall remain recoverable.
7. Cross-DC processing behavior shall be deterministic.
```

