# 18. Acceptance Criteria

Acceptance criteria are the most important section for AI-generated tests.

Use **Given / When / Then**.

Example:

```text
AC-001

Given:
A valid prefund file exists.

When:
The file is submitted.

Then:
The file is registered successfully.

And:
A unique File ID is generated.

And:
The file state becomes REGISTERED.
```

Negative scenario:

```text
AC-002

Given:
The same file has already been processed.

When:
The file is submitted again.

Then:
The platform shall identify it as duplicate.

And:
No duplicate transaction shall be created.

And:
No duplicate reservation request shall be sent.
```

Recovery:

```text
AC-003

Given:
A transaction is persisted.

When:
The application terminates before reservation publication.

Then:
The transaction shall remain recoverable.

And:
A recovery process shall eventually publish the reservation request.

And:
Only one effective reservation request shall be processed.
```

